Hi Tracy,

Thank you for meeting today. Attached are the order terms we agreed and the r=
ollout briefing we walked through. The order covers 120 seats at USD 54,000 a=
nnually for July 1, 2025 through June 30, 2026. The six weeks beginning this =
week are for preparation and staged early opening, ahead of that annual perio=
d.

Divya and I will meet you on May 7 to look at the training room. Please final=
ize the Dispatch, Site Operations and Office rosters by May 9. Divya will che=
ck assignments with you, and we will decide when to open each group as its ro=
ster is ready rather than switch everyone at once. The briefing sets out the =
planned order and the June 13 handoff.

Please let me know if anything may affect the roster date before our room vis=
it.

Thanks,
Michelle

